      "contextBefore": "```swift\nlet kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput: CFString\n```",
      "contextAfter": "When a decoder produces RAW output the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) automatically invokes a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) with default settings and emits processed frames by default, or when `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is set to `kCFBooleanFalse`.",
