      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When a decoder produces RAW output the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) automatically invokes a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) with default settings and emits processed frames by default, or when `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is set to `kCFBooleanFalse`.",
      "normalizedSource": "When a decoder produces RAW output the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) automatically invokes a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) with default settings and emits processed frames by default, or when `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is set to `kCFBooleanFalse`.",
      "sourceHash": "89536a340893a038292739ddaf0188071b4d955894ce243602458ebb1b726bf7",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "If you want to run a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) on the RAW output to control the post-decode processing of the decoded `CVPixelBuffer` objects, you must set `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` to `kCFBooleanTrue`.",
      "documentTitle": "kVTDecompressionPropertyKeyRequestRAWOutput",
      "framework": "VideoToolbox",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If you want to run a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) on the RAW output to control the post-decode processing of the decoded `CVPixelBuffer` objects, you must set `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` to `kCFBooleanTrue`.",
      "normalizedSource": "If you want to run a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) on the RAW output to control the post-decode processing of the decoded `CVPixelBuffer` objects, you must set `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` to `kCFBooleanTrue`.",
      "sourceHash": "bf005c893700c2f0265dcfdca823356d9bc64c83b3622f770622801ce5091f59",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "When a decoder produces RAW output the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) automatically invokes a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) with default settings and emits processed frames by default, or when `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is set to `kCFBooleanFalse`.",
      "contextAfter": "If `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is enabled and the decoder produces RAW output, the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) returns `CVPixelBuffer` objects in the decoder’s native RAW format, and ignores any specified image buffer attributes.",
      "documentTitle": "kVTDecompressionPropertyKeyRequestRAWOutput",
      "framework": "VideoToolbox",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
