    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is enabled and the decoder produces RAW output, the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) returns `CVPixelBuffer` objects in the decoder’s native RAW format, and ignores any specified image buffer attributes.",
      "normalizedSource": "If `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` is enabled and the decoder produces RAW output, the [`VTDecompressionSession`](vtdecompressionsession.md) returns `CVPixelBuffer` objects in the decoder’s native RAW format, and ignores any specified image buffer attributes.",
      "sourceHash": "937a23251a30a8b1abb9814da4301eddd43aedfef74f64ffcf2ad568be0ddf2b",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If you want to run a [`VTRAWProcessingSession`](vtrawprocessingsession.md) on the RAW output to control the post-decode processing of the decoded `CVPixelBuffer` objects, you must set `kVTDecompressionPropertyKey_RequestRAWOutput` to `kCFBooleanTrue`.",
